---
permalink: /version.txt
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#-
  A plain-text stamp of what this domain is actually serving, so the whole
  deploy chain - merge, cron pull, build, rsync - can be checked from outside
  with one request:

    curl -s https://dermotcochran.com/version.txt

  This is the only check that tests the chain end to end. A green cron job
  proves the script ran; it does not prove the files landed.

  version "dev" means the build did not come through the cPanel deploy path
  (a local build, or a GitHub Pages PR preview). Kept out of collections so
  it never reaches the sitemap, search index or any listing page.
-#}
version: {{ build.version }}
built: {{ build.builtAt }}
domain: {{ site.url }}
